$ c_(upright("target")) = & \(tt("human_clinical_cohort")\,med tt("established_chronic_fibrosis")\, \ & tt("oral_steady_state_bid")\,med tt("spirometric_clinical_endpoint")\). $

The drug, the studies, and the numbers are invented for illustration. Across the $6 times 3 times 3 times 3 = 162$ contexts of its lattice, evaluating all 26,244 ordered context pairs yields 3,240 `DIRECT_MATCH`, 6,462 `BOUNDED_BRIDGE` and 16,542 `INADMISSIBLE_TRANSFER` classifications. Its raw corpus $D_0$ (SHA-256 prefix `a12490cea51f`) contains 5 studies, 11 arm variables and 9 evidence atoms, and three reversible `JSONPatch` events reach settled corpus $D_3$ (SHA-256 prefix `93b4de08b9a8`): `PATCH-001` retypes `S101:O1`’s $72.0 %$ `COL1A1` mRNA reduction from `"point_level"` to `"relative_change"`\; `PATCH-002` restores the dropped active comparator `VAR:S102:Pirfenidone_100mgkg` in three-arm murine study `S102:O1`\; and `PATCH-003` sets `requires_figure_digitization = true` on Kaplan–Meier curve readout `S102:O2` so $I_5$ blocks exact quantitative promotion.

